/T (HR management has changed dramatically in recent decades. It has shifted from a largely administrative focus to becoming a strategic ally in managing overall business performance. Most organizations recognize that people are their most important asset. Therefore, how can HR professionals continue to make gains as a strategic business partner by both managing people more effectively and by leveraging data analytics?)
